800: /// `attempt fail`：Attempt 必须 `Running`；`status = Failed`，记 `fail_reason`（≤ 4096）；
801: /// 真实失败数超过 `max_retries` 时 Work → `Blocked(RetriesExhausted)`。效果 `RefreshStatusCard`。
802: fn decide_fail(
